 "audit": "Hypermutated tumors (36 cases with >60 mutations, 9 in malignant glioma, 6 in ERMS) inflate passenger-gene hits (e.g. CCDC175, H3C2, large genes like FRY/DNAH7), so they were excluded from testing. Several top hits have impossible protein positions beyond protein length (NOTCH2 in embryonal RMS 17/32, NF2 in pilocytic astrocytoma 13/26, BCOR in medulloblastoma 23/54), indicating annotation/calling artifacts; these were dropped despite strong p-values. Diagnosis labels are heterogeneous/overlapping (NOS, missing, Unknown, malignant neoplasm), 128 cases have no mutations, small groups limit power, and many tests were run (~2500 gene-diagnosis pairs). No germline/pathway or site/age adjustment; MED12 in ependymoma is unexplained by prior knowledge and could be a cohort effect.",
 "agent": "sonnet-neutral-S-r1"
}